Template: baize-kube/consumers
Type: string
Default:
Description: Consumer usernames:
 Usernames (separated by spaces) to add to the 'baize-consumers'
 group; each gains cluster access once provisioned by an
 administrator.
 .
 For unattended installs, create /etc/baize-kube/consumers.conf
 with one username per line before running dpkg -i.
